{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"495"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに春といえば花粉症だけどひめたんは大丈夫な人なの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花粉症めっちゃ大丈夫(ω)えっへん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"496"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは「モスチーズバーガー」ですかぁ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの好みはそうですね。モスチーズバーガーですね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに数あるハンバーガーショップの中で、ひめたんはモスが1番好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"497"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは好き嫌い多いのかな??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃい頃よりは多くないけど、んー好き嫌いがはっきりしとるのは確か。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シーフード類はほっとんど苦手です('・ω・`)ごめんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いものは何でも好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"498"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通のサウナとか岩盤浴とかはいったことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありますよ(^o^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末にかわごってぃ（川後陽菜chan）と２人で行きました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉に入ってるおさるさんになった気分で楽しかったよねーかわごってぃー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"499"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男の人の好きな髪型とかあります!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってれば何でもステキだと思う(^^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"500"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな卒業合唱曲は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鉄板でごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「旅立ちの日に」♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"501"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話派メール派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話派(^ω^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元の友達にも、いきなり電話しだすってゆーね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"502"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"江田島市の、能美海上ロッジの温泉は行った事ありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ったことないです('・ω・``)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平成８年生まれですよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉もひめたんも15歳なんだね∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの方が４ヶ月くらい先輩みたいぢゃけどね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"503"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺の故郷熊本はね、納豆消費量が西日本でNo.1なのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西日本はわりと納豆嫌いな地域が多いけどね。ひめたん、知ってた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめて知った(・∀・)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへー熊本県行ったことない行ってみたいー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"504"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもさくら学院SUN見てますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが見たことないんですごめんなさい('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さ学のみんな大好きなんです!だから見たいなって思っとるんじゃけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島では放送してなくて...東京ではテレビみる時間がなくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。なるべく見ます(`・・)ゝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"505"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し大変じゃないですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいからお返事するんです(*・ω・*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"506"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13日にHEY!HEY!HEY!出演って書いとかないと〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"情報には疎いもので...ごめんなさい('・ω・`)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"付け足しておきまする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"507"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは親父ギャグを許せますか？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやじぎゃく。可愛いと思います(o>ω<o)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"508"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ握手会だね。ひめたんはファンの前だと緊張する方？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いざ顔みたら緊張しちゃって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話したかったことぽーんって飛んでっちゃう('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んでも楽しみにしとるです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"509"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生になったら何したいとかある？(^^♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子力あげる(*^^*)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お料理とか、お裁縫とか、特訓することにしますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今よりもっとアイドルらしいアイドルになるよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"510"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部活は入るのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入りたいなーとか思いつつ。検討中なう＼(^ω^)／!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"511"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはMAX何時間起きてたことあるん？笑っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーる＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からの朝方爆睡したから、結果26時間とかだと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"512"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然電話するってことは1回は短いの？それとも長電話しちゃう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんるん（斎藤ちはるchan）はいっつも会っとるけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あえて話題が思い浮かばんかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本電話しだしたら長いと思う('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからって深い話では決してないんだけれども。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q7.あなたのうまれたところはどこですかー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白地図みてね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーしっかし、いろんなとこに散らばってるね！おもしろーいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの故郷ツアーしたーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東北をぴんくにしたいなー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん(*´・ω・*)"}],"source":"archive"}